1. detach_task_profile from destination_availability_alpha to free route_task_profile_alpha.
   Action: detach_task_profile ?candidate - candidate_entity ?route_task_profile - route_task_profile
   Parameters: destination_availability_alpha, route_task_profile_alpha.

